{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-6-1-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_6_1_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:n-6-1-1:p1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本章描述研究药物合成药X注射制剂及安慰剂的身份、剂型/规格、给药途径、暴露剂量与产品权威来源。研究药物身份、剂型、途径与剂量应仅采用本项目产品权威事实，不应沿用模板示例剂量或其他项目信息。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:n-6-1-1:p2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究药物为合成药X注射制剂，名称合成药X，剂型为注射制剂，规格为150 mg/1.0 mL，作用机制为IL-4Rα（白介素-4受体α）拮抗。对照为生理盐水安慰剂（1.0 mL），应按同体积、同途径、同频率皮下注射。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:n-6-1-1:p3\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究药物给药途径应为皮下注射。暴露剂量应为150 mg（1.0 mL）；负荷期为第1、8、15、22天每周一次，共4次；维持期自第36天起每两周一次，至第24周末次给药。试验参与者实际接受的研究药物或安慰剂信息应与本章及给药方案章节一致。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:n-6-1-1:table:intervention\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"tbl:n-6-1-1:intervention\",\n        \"block_id\": \"blk:n-6-1-1:table:intervention\",\n        \"title\": \"研究药物描述与产品权威\",\n        \"domain\": \"treatment_dose\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"schema_version\": \"structured_table_v1\",\n        \"source_locator\": \"\",\n        \"version\": 0,\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col:n-6-1-1:item\",\n            \"label\": \"项目\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"parameter\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col:n-6-1-1:value\",\n            \"label\": \"内容\",\n       